  "description": "Extras: Bright LED headlight, rear rack, and an intuitive LCD display\n\nThe VTUVIA SX20 is a compact and powerful folding e-bike designed for riders who prioritize convenience and performance. Its 750W motor delivers impressive power, making it ideal for urban commuting and weekend adventures. With 80Nm of torque, the SX20 provides quick acceleration and steady climbing ability on various terrains.\nPowered by a 48V 14Ah battery, the SX20 offers a range of up to 70 miles on pedal assist, ensuring you can ride longer without frequent recharges. Whether you're commuting to work, exploring the city, or enjoying a scenic ride, this e-bike is built for versatility and endurance.\nThe Shimano 7-speed drivetrain allows riders to seamlessly switch gears for different riding conditions, while the front suspension fork absorbs shocks for a smoother experience on rough roads. Its step-through foldable frame makes it incredibly convenient to store, transport, and handle—perfect for those with limited space or who need a portable travel companion.\nEquipped with dual disc brakes, the SX20 ensures reliable stopping power, even at higher speeds. The intuitive LCD display provides real-time riding data, while the integrated LED headlight and rear rack add practicality for daily use. Whether you need a reliable commuter or an adventure-ready e-bike, the VTUVIA SX20 is your go-to choice for performance, comfort, and portability.",
